      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This English translation of “Zeh Yom Rishon” was made by Dr. Gabriel Wasserman. The piyyut can be found on p. 123 of סידור התפילות כמנהג הקראים, Volume 4 (1889). Also find, another version of “Zeh Yom Rishon” by Ḥakham Zerah ben Natan of Troki.</tei:p>
